<title>FRANCE: French cocoa bean imports down yr/yr in February.</title>
<headline>French cocoa bean imports down yr/yr in February.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>French cocoa bean imports issued by French customs (in tonnes).</p>
<p>		   Feb 97     Feb 96     Jan-Feb 97    Jan-Feb 96</p>
<p>Ivory Coast    6,486	 4,998	 15,207	   9,539</p>
<p>Ghana		853	 1,307	  1,890	   2,616</p>
<p>Nigeria	    864	 1,573	  2,362	   2,726</p>
<p>Cameroon	   360	   563	    762	   1,203</p>
<p>Indonesia	  253	 1,269	  1,028	   2,704</p>
<p>World total    9,450	10,254	 22,270	  20,092</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432853+</p>
</text>
